{{Term/Store|Tireless Frog|Tireless Frogs|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Tireless Frog}}
Tireless Frogs are a type of [[Frog]] that can be found near ponds in the [[Lanayru Great Spring]] and [[Hyrule Ridge]], but they only appear during the [[Rain]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When [[Link]] approaches a Tireless Frog, it will run away. To circumvent this, Link can sneak up to them, stun them, or chase after them. Tireless Frogs can be combined with [[Monster Part]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make an [[Enduring Elixir]], which will grant [[Extra Stamina]] when consumed.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Tireless Frogs can be used to make [[Crimson Dye]].

